#: src/Admin/HelpDocumentationPage.php:57
msgid ""
"Custom values generally take priority over automatic fallbacks. SEO output "
"can be affected by themes, caching, multilingual plugins and other SEO "
"plugins. Avoid duplicate metadata providers."
